WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.760
Nuits Receipts installs like an app (PWA).

2
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:08.550
On iPhone, open it in Safari, tap More,
then Share, Add to Home Screen, and Add.

3
00:00:08.850 --> 00:00:12.780
On Android, open it in Chrome,
tap the menu, then Install.

4
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.810
On a computer, sign in, then click
the install icon in the address bar.

5
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.120
It opens in its own window,
one tap from your receipts.

